      "id": "Imageflow.NativeTool.ubuntu-x86_64",
      "range": "*"
    },
    "message": "This package includes or references a version of Google's libwebp that is vulnerable to maliciously crafted images. Update to the latest version immediately if you process untrusted images with this tool. See https://github.com/imazen/imageflow/security/advisories/GHSA-7vpr-3ppw-qrpj for more information. If you're using macOS, version 11 or higher is required. If you're on Linux,  libc 2.31 or higher is required, which usually means a distribution version that has not past EOL.",
